# --- Audited named-key and structured-constructor rulings ------------------ #
# These signs are deliberately absent from gmeow:gmnDenotationGrapheme. Named
# keys execute through the current dict-v3; structured/rejected candidates preserve the
# familiar display symbol only as evidence, never as an ambiguous flat alias.

