# External-corpus mathematics coverage: conventional display notation is audited
# here in the language grounding slice, while the mathematical referents remain
# owned by math:.  No overloaded glyph is silently promoted to an executable
# alias; the disposition records the named key or structured constructor that
# preserves the missing arity, grade, or semantic context.

