    gmeow:gmnDispositionBasis gmeow:gmnBasisAmbiguity ;
    gmeow:gmnDispositionRationale "The bare capital I is confusable with an identity matrix, an index, and Fisher information, and mutual information is written I(X;Y) over a joint distribution with a mandatory base; the `mutual_information` key keeps the two-argument frame explicit and adopts no glyph, so the GMN glyph-table version is unchanged." ;
    gmeow:gmnCandidateDenotation gmeow:gmnDenMathMutualInformation ;
    gmeow:cites gmeow:gmnInformationTheoryWork , gmeow:gmnUnicodeMathWork ;
