# The Mapper construction's output nerve, written N(𝒰) for the nerve of a cover
# 𝒰, warrants its own symbol decision: the bare capital N is ambiguous with the
# natural numbers, a count, a normal subgroup, and a null space, and the nerve
# carries the cover/clustering frame that a flat glyph cannot hold. The
# disposition is gmnDispositionNamedKey, so no glyph enters the executable GMN
# glyph table and the pinned gmnGlyphTableVersion is unchanged.
gmeow:gmnCandidateMathNerve
    a gmeow:GmnSymbolCandidate ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang> ;
    rdfs:label "GMN candidate: nerve of a cover N"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The audited named-key ruling for the N(𝒰) notation of math:NerveComplex, the simplicial complex a Mapper construction outputs as the nerve of its cover-refined clustering."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:gmnCandidateTarget math:NerveComplex ;
    gmeow:gmnCandidateGlyph "N" ;
    gmeow:gmnAsciiFallback "nerve" ;
    gmeow:gmnSpokenLabel "nerve of the cover" ;
    gmeow:gmnArity 1 ;
    gmeow:gmnSymbolDisposition gmeow:gmnDispositionNamedKey ;
    gmeow:gmnDispositionBasis gmeow:gmnBasisAmbiguity ;
    gmeow:gmnDispositionRationale "The bare capital N denotes the natural numbers, a count or sample size, a normal subgroup, and a null space, and the nerve is written N(𝒰) over a declared cover whose overlaps a flat glyph cannot carry; the `nerve` key keeps the cover/clustering frame of the Mapper output explicit and adopts no glyph, so the GMN glyph-table version is unchanged." ;
    gmeow:gmnCandidateDenotation gmeow:gmnDenMathNerve ;
    gmeow:cites gmeow:gmnOpenMathWork , gmeow:gmnUnicodeMathWork ;
