lang:DuplicateSlotIndex a logic:Situation .
lang:ExactPreservationViolated a logic:Situation .
lang:FabricatedEquivalence a logic:Situation .
lang:FregeConflation a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnCodebookDigestMismatch a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnCompactionOverclaim a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnCompactionWithoutProvenance a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnConfusableGlyph a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnDictionaryAliasCollision a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnGlyphCollision a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnGraphOutOfDomain a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnMalformedNumber a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnMissingEnvelopeField a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnNonCanonicalCodepoint a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnNonCanonicalOrder a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnNonDecodableGrammar a logic:Situation .
lang:GmnRingLatticeMalformed a logic:Situation .
